                <pb facs="0126" n="76" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg76"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-28"><hi rendition="#italic">November 28, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received November 30.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>The new minister for foreign affairs has flour claims under consideration, and
                    promises definite conclusion in a few days.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
